1
00:00:00,159 --> 00:00:02,499
(Sheldon:)Thank my friend, Wil Wheaton.

2
00:00:02,928 --> 00:00:05,428
(Sheldon:)For your information,
I have nine friends.

3
00:00:07,366 --> 00:00:09,246
(Sheldon:)Ten if we include you.

4
00:00:10,569 --> 00:00:12,109
(Sheldon:)Nine it is.

5
00:00:15,875 --> 00:00:18,545
Eh, it's ten.
I'll count Wolowitz.

6
00:00:20,079 --> 00:00:23,059
(Sheldon:)-Hello, friend Leonard.
-Hoy, you're in a good mood.

7
00:00:23,215 --> 00:00:24,525
(Sheldon:)I'm in a great mood.

8
00:00:24,683 --> 00:00:26,683
(Leonard:)Well, you're about to be
in an even better one.

9
00:00:26,852 --> 00:00:29,132
(Leonard:)I didn't want to say anything
until I knew for sure, but...

10
00:00:29,288 --> 00:00:31,858
(Leonard:)I've been re-running the tests
on your element in my lab

11
00:00:32,024 --> 00:00:33,804
(Leonard:)and I disproved it.

12
00:00:33,959 --> 00:00:35,369
Your element does not exist!

13
00:00:36,429 --> 00:00:38,569
(Sheldon:)Yeah, but what about
the Chinese research team?

14
00:00:38,697 --> 00:00:39,577
(Sheldon:)They found it.

15
00:00:39,732 --> 00:00:43,302
(Leonard:)Yeah, it turns out someone added
simulated signals to the data files.

16
00:00:43,469 --> 00:00:44,919
(Leonard:)They faked the results.

17
00:00:45,071 --> 00:00:46,071
(Sheldon:)Really?

18
00:00:46,238 --> 00:00:47,908
Yes!
Do you know what that means?

19
00:00:48,074 --> 00:00:50,914
It means that all of this
attention that you hate goes away.

20
00:00:51,077 --> 00:00:52,957
(Sheldon:)-So no more interviews?
-No, it's all over.

21
00:00:53,112 --> 00:00:54,922
(Sheldon:)-I can't believe it.
-Well, you're welcome.

22
00:00:55,081 --> 00:00:59,021
(Sheldon:)You robbed me
of my greatest achievement!

